<Information title="About" description="A practical course in writing, testing and improving your own skills and workflows with coding agents.">
<p class="lead">Learn to write, test and improve your own skills, rules and workflows.</p>
<p>Vibe Coding for Adults is a course by <a href="https://almirsarajcic.com">Almir Sarajčić</a> for people who already use coding agents and keep repeating instructions or adjusting the result.</p>
<p>The first season uses the course platform as an ongoing example. Each lesson introduces a method, demonstrates it on a real piece of work and checks the result. Notes, guided practice and homework help you apply the method to a project of your own.</p>
<p>The examples include tools from the Kogen ecosystem. You can use your own setup and create your own artifacts. <a href="/#course">Explore the working curriculum</a>.</p>
</Information>
